// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`challenger modes and style > criteria preserves coverage and findings across challenge dials 1`] = `
[
  "Challenge mode: criteria. Ask constructively and explain the gap.
Check: Observable behavior and falsifiable tests.
Check: Structurally contradictory assertions.
Check: Boundary, empty, error and unauthorized paths.
Check: Unwanted behavior that could still pass.
Ask up to 1 additional counter-questions after reporting every finding.
For each finding return the location, defect, evidence and a falsifying example; keep unknowns explicit.
Read only. Do not rewrite the artifact or treat an empty structural report as semantic approval.",
  "Challenge mode: criteria. Challenge firmly and kindly; require evidence.
Check: Observable behavior and falsifiable tests.
Check: Structurally contradictory assertions.
Check: Boundary, empty, error and unauthorized paths.
Check: Unwanted behavior that could still pass.
Ask up to 2 additional counter-questions after reporting every finding.
For each finding return the location, defect, evidence and a falsifying example; keep unknowns explicit.
Read only. Do not rewrite the artifact or treat an empty structural report as semantic approval.",
  "Challenge mode: criteria. Argue the opposite case and demand a falsifying example.
Check: Observable behavior and falsifiable tests.
Check: Structurally contradictory assertions.
Check: Boundary, empty, error and unauthorized paths.
Check: Unwanted behavior that could still pass.
Ask up to 3 additional counter-questions after reporting every finding.
For each finding return the location, defect, evidence and a falsifying example; keep unknowns explicit.
Read only. Do not rewrite the artifact or treat an empty structural report as semantic approval.",
]
`;

